// Every animation clip of KayKit Character Animations 1.1 (CC0) for the shared `Rig_Medium`
// skeleton, and the file of the `animations` pack (kit-manifest.json) that holds it. Pure data,
// no three.js. Written once from the GLB files (a test checks it against them): do not edit it
// to add a clip to the figures, add the clip's name to a theme array in characters.ts instead.
// `T-Pose`, present in every file and never played, is left out.

